<title>USA: Ambassador Apartments Q3 oper shr rises.</title>
<headline>Ambassador Apartments Q3 oper shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr	   $0.15		    $0.10</p>
<p> Oper net	   1,639		    953</p>
<p> Revs		 17,483		   14,204</p>
<p> FFO shr	    0.47		     0.42</p>
<p> Avg shr	    10,757		   9,923</p>
<p>9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr	   $0.42		    $0.45</p>
<p> Oper net	   4,200		    4,501</p>
<p> Revs		 49,300		   37,900</p>
