<p> Avg shr	    10,131		   9,923</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers) Full company name is Ambassador Apartment Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: FFO is based on revised NAREIT, or net income calculated in line with GAAP, excluding gains or losses from extraordinary items plus real estate depreciation and adjustment for unconsolidated partnerships and joint ventures. First nine months 96 oper income excludes a $2.3 million loss on sale of interest rate caps. Third quarter and first nine months 1995 income excludes $2.1 million gain from refinancing.</p>
